{start_of_verse}
Please remember that I love you
And I hope you’ll not forget
Each hour each day our love grows stronger
Since the day that we first met
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
Nothing now can separate us
Nothing but the end of time
Please remember that I love you
